# ==============================================================================
# ARTNCE Painting Cost Calculator - Environment Variables
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. DATABASE (Optional for local/preview, Required for cloud persistence)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PostgreSQL Connection URL. Supported providers: Supabase, Neon, Vercel Postgres, AWS RDS, etc.
# If not provided, the application will gracefully run in standalone mode using browser localStorage.
# Example: postgresql://postgres:[PASSWORD]@[HOST]:5432/[DB_NAME]?sslmode=require
DATABASE_URL=""

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. APPLICATION URL (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Base URL for public links or API references.
# Example: http://localhost:3000 or https://artnce-calculator.vercel.app
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. API SECURITY (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional secret key for securing internal administrative API routes.
# Example: generate with `openssl rand -base64 32`
API_SECRET_KEY=""
